            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1038/clpt.2010.58</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The FDA advisory on long-acting beta-agonists (LABAs) is not based on new data but on ongoing safety concerns about this class of medication. Not to be ignored are the potential safety risks of short-acting beta-agonists (SABAs).</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
